<title>UK: SOCCER-HIBERNIAN WIN SCOTTISH LEAGUE PLAY-OFF.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HIBERNIAN WIN SCOTTISH LEAGUE PLAY-OFF.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Scottish League</p>
<p>play-off, second leg on Thursday:</p>
<p> Airdrieonians    2     Hibernian    4</p>
<p>Hibernian won 5-2 on aggregate and remain in the premier</p>
<p>division.</p>
</text>
